    "description": "You learn your enemy's preferred tactics quickly. When an enemy character makes a melee attack against you for at least the second time in an encounter, make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">Reaction</a>. If the check is successful, you gain a +1 bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> against that character until the end of the encounter.<br><br>You can use this against only one character at a time, until that character is incapacitated or killed, or until you voluntarily switch targets by dropping the use of this Talent for one full round (you can take other <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Actions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Actions\">Actions</a> normally).",
